@@ -3,3 +3,8 @@
 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386).
+Object patches merge recursively, a member whose patch value is `null` removes that member, and
+non-object patches replace the target document. The function returns a new JSON value and leaves
+both inputs unchanged.
